00:59:10,817 --> 00:59:12,817
I'll just give you one other piece of background.

618
00:59:14,918 --> 00:59:23,181
When Washington DC passed this about three years ago, their ban actually went into, the phase-out is over, the ban went into effect this calendar year.

619
00:59:24,701 --> 00:59:30,423
It did start a trickle of similar laws in surrounding towns.

